  {
   "pages": "engineering",
   "where": "p",
   "en": ". Considering the poor assembly efficiency obtained with MoClo in DBTL cycle 1, we decided to switch to the STK system. To convert the coding sequence from our original MoClo design into an STK-compatible Level 1 part, we designed the forward primer (Ho1 F) and reverse primer (pcyA R) to PCR-amplify each CDS as a single amplicon directly from our existing MoClo construct: Ho1 F/pcyA R for the Ho1-pcyA fusion, ccaSm3 F/ccaSm3 R for ccaSm3, and ccaR F/ccaR R for ccaR. Additionally, we also had to PCR-amplify the promoter for our light-responsive expression module from the original MoClo construct utilizing P",
   "zh": "。考慮到 DBTL 循環 1 用 MoClo 得到的組裝效率不佳，我們決定改用 STK 系統。為了把原本 MoClo 設計中的編碼序列轉成與 STK 相容的 Level 1 元件，我們設計了正向引子（Ho1 F）與反向引子（pcyA R），直接從既有的 MoClo 構築把每條 CDS 以單一擴增產物的形式擴增出來：Ho1-pcyA 融合用 Ho1 F/pcyA R，ccaSm3 用 ccaSm3 F/ccaSm3 R，ccaR 用 ccaR F/ccaR R。此外，我們也必須從原本的 MoClo 構築擴增光反應表現模組的啟動子，所用的引子是 P"
  },
