  {
   "pages": "engineering",
   "where": "p",
   "en": "Moreover, the lessons learned in the DBTL 1 cycle regarding low assembly efficiency of our desired Level 1 constitutive constructs led us to conclude that the circuits needed to be redesigned. We received the SubtiToolKit (STK) from Dr Joaquín Caro-Astorga",
   "zh": "此外，DBTL 1 循環中關於我們所需 Level 1 組成型構築組裝效率偏低的經驗，讓我們判斷迴路需要重新設計。我們從 Dr Joaquín Caro-Astorga 收到 SubtiToolKit（STK）"
  },
