  {
   "pages": "engineering",
   "where": "p",
   "en": "and paired with the cargo sequences the project needed, LEA14, ACCD and BoPep4. To get those into MoClo 2.0 as transcription units, each module was given a standard set of regulatory parts, and every part got a custom primer pair carrying type IIS sites: BbsI and BpiI for Level 0 entry, BsaI for Level 1, each flanked by the standard overhangs. That hierarchy is the one the build kept, even after the kit under it was swapped.",
   "zh": "，並與本計畫所需的載荷序列 LEA14、ACCD 與 BoPep4 配對。為了把這些序列以轉錄單元的形式放進 MoClo 2.0，每個模組都配上一組標準調控元件，而每個元件都有一對帶 type IIS 位的自訂引子：Level 0 入門用 BbsI 與 BpiI，Level 1 用 BsaI，各自以標準黏接端側接。即使底下的套件後來換掉，這個層級架構仍被保留下來。"
