   "en": "A 3D model of the ReLEAF bioreactor, seen through its open side and rocking gently from side to side: a black portable case containing the culture vessel, the pumps, the hollow-fibre cartridge, the in-line photometer and the bottles, lit by a strip of green light.",
   "zh": "ReLEAF 生物反應器的 3D 模型，從打開的一側看進去，並緩緩左右搖擺：一只黑色手提箱，裡面裝著培養槽、幫浦、中空纖維匣、線上光度計與瓶子，由一條綠色燈條照亮。",
   "attr": "aria-label"
  },
  {
   "pages": "data-physicalization-listening",
   "where": "@aria-label",
   "en": "Chart comparing click pitch for background noise and four plant stress conditions, in two shaded zones. The regular zone, about 23 to 38 kHz, holds only healthy-plant clicks and sits clearly apart. The stressed zone, roughly 37 to 67 kHz, holds all four stress conditions overlapping heavily, with medians between 46 and 57 kHz. Full statistics are in the paragraph below the chart.",
   "zh": "比較背景噪音與四種植物逆境條件之喀嚓聲音高的圖表，分成兩塊有底色的區域。正常區約在 23 至 38 kHz，只含健康植株的喀嚓聲，明顯自成一區。受逆境區大致在 37 至 67 kHz，四種逆境條件全落在其中、彼此大量重疊，中位數在 46 至 57 kHz 之間。完整統計在圖表下方的段落中。",
   "attr": "aria-label"
  },
  {
